  "details": "At the moment it's possible to run into a gotcha when using certain GameObject.Find(string name) arguments, due to VRChat specifically filtering out protected objects.\nObviously the ideal here is that the Udon call for GameObject.Find should, well, not be able to find protected VRChat objects (!) but there are two other avenues to explore:\n1. Throw an error if an Udon call of GameObject.Find tries to grab a VRChat protected object.\n2. Document on the website what strings should not be searched for.",
